And especially... for the bride and groom.

776
01:08:18,000 --> 01:08:22,000
Silav ji canê te re Hesen, canê Hesen!
 
Greetings to your soul Hasan, soul of Hasan!

777
01:08:22,000 --> 01:08:27,000
Hesen bira... Ev silav ji hezkiriyên te re Hesen.
 
Brother Hasan... This greeting is for your loved ones,
Hasan.

778
01:08:27,000 --> 01:08:31,000
Li Almanya ha...
 
In Germany...

779
01:08:31,000 --> 01:08:35,000
Birayê wî Xelîl, Hesen.
 
His brother Xelil, Hasan.

780
01:08:35,000 --> 01:08:40,000
Silav ji malbatê ra!
 
Greetings to the family!

781
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:43,000
Bavê Arif pêşî...
 
First of all, Arif's father...

782
01:08:43,000 --> 01:08:49,000
Çi qas jî malbata wan heye, ser seran û ser çavan!
 
All of their family, upon our heads and eyes!

783
01:08:49,000 --> 01:08:54,000
Di serî de silav ji Xalê te ra, Xalê Hesen!
 
Above all, greetings to your uncle, Uncle Hasan!

784
01:08:54,000 --> 01:08:58,000
Silav ji pismam Hesen!
 
Greetings from cousin Hasan!

785
01:08:58,000 --> 01:09:02,000
Hesen can! Hesen can! Hesen!
 
Dear Hasan! Dear Hasan! Hasan!

786
01:09:02,000 --> 01:09:07,000
Silav! Emê şeva xwe bi we re şêrîn kin, heta sibê Hesen!
 
Greetings! We will make our night sweet with you, until
morning Hasan!

787
01:09:07,000 --> 01:09:12,000
Hesen tu sergovend î Hesen!
 
Hasan, you are leading the dance Hasan!

788
01:09:12,000 --> 01:09:17,000
Di eynî demê de Fazil Emer, mamoste Fazil.
 
At the same time Fazil Emer, teacher Fazil.

789
01:09:17,000 --> 01:09:20,000
Hevalê me Ereb a, ser seran û ser çavan a.
 
Our Arab friend, upon our heads and eyes.

790
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:24,000
Ya Fazil.
 
Oh Fazil.

791
01:09:24,000 --> 01:09:28,000
Ya Fazil.
 
Oh Fazil.

792
01:09:28,000 --> 01:09:34,000
Û ev şev taybet ji te re Hesen, tu bi xêr hatî ser çavan.
 
And this night is special for you Hasan, you are welcome
upon our eyes.

793
01:09:34,000 --> 01:09:39,000
Û bavê Elî yê min, tu ser çavan...
 
And my Eli's father, you are upon our eyes...

794
01:09:39,000 --> 01:09:42,000
Ev canê te, Bavê Fûad a!
 
This is your soul, Fuad's father!

795
01:09:42,000 --> 01:09:47,000
Û serê dîlanê, silav li dîlanê te!
 
And the head of the dance, greetings to your dance!

796
01:09:47,000 --> 01:09:51,000
Taybet, Hesen!
 
Specially, Hasan!

797
01:09:51,000 --> 01:10:11,000
Bûk û zava, ji canê Hesen û Xelîl Hesen.
 
The bride and groom, from dear Hasan and Xelil Hasan.

798
01:10:18,000 --> 01:10:20,000
Pêra werin ha!
 
Follow along!

799
01:10:20,000 --> 01:10:40,000
Allah, Allah, Allah, Allah!
 
God, God, God, God!

800
01:10:56,000 --> 01:10:58,000
Her bijî sergovendê, her bijî!
 
Long live the head of the dance, long live!

801
01:10:58,000 --> 01:11:03,000
Emrê te dirêj be!
 
May your life be long!

